  "rows": [
    {
      "id": "h001",
      "startSeconds": 0.4,
      "endSeconds": 9.9,
      "narration": "减肥，光靠少吃就够了吗？肚子上的脂肪，怎么牵动血糖、血压和血脂？咱们从这顿饭说起。",
      "group": "opening-life",
      "view": "meal",
      "parent": "mealPerson",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 3.2,
      "sampleFrames": [
        63,
        163,
        254
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h002",
      "startSeconds": 9.9,
      "endSeconds": 18.833,
      "narration": "先看这顿家常饭：米饭、肉菜，再来一杯甜饮。吃下去以后，身体得把这批营养安排到合适的地方。",
      "group": "opening-life",
      "view": "meal",
      "parent": "mealPerson",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 3.2,
      "sampleFrames": [
        345,
        439,
        524
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h003",
      "startSeconds": 18.833,
      "endSeconds": 28.567,
      "narration": "血糖、血脂和血压，都和这趟运输有关。脂肪积得多了，处理营养、推动血流的几个环节，就可能一起吃力。",
      "group": "body-map",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.42,
      "sampleFrames": [
        617,
        719,
        813
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h004",
      "startSeconds": 28.567,
      "endSeconds": 37.9,
      "narration": "右下角的尺子，表示正在看的这一层有多大。镜头往里走时，尺子也跟着变；一微米，是千分之一毫米。",
      "group": "body-map",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.42,
      "sampleFrames": [
        907,
        1005,
        1095
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h005",
      "startSeconds": 37.9,
      "endSeconds": 46.2,
      "narration": "米饭里的淀粉，经过消化变成葡萄糖。它从小肠进入血液，饭后的血糖便开始往上走。",
      "group": "digestive",
      "view": "gut",
      "parent": "small_intestine",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.65,
      "sampleFrames": [
        1181,
        1268,
        1348
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h006",
      "startSeconds": 46.2,
      "endSeconds": 55.367,
      "narration": "一部分糖马上供能，一部分存进肝脏和肌肉。血里不能一直堆着，身体得通知各处，把新来的糖接走。",
      "group": "metabolic-macro",
      "view": "liver",
      "parent": "liver",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.62,
      "sampleFrames": [
        1435,
        1531,
        1619
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h007",
      "startSeconds": 55.367,
      "endSeconds": 67.067,
      "narration": "这时，胰腺里的胰岛会增加胰岛素分泌。它沿血液到达肌肉，也提醒肝脏，饭后少往血里放糖。",
      "group": "pancreatic-macro",
      "view": "pancreas",
      "parent": "pancreas",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.46,
      "sampleFrames": [
        1724,
        1847,
        1959
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h008",
      "startSeconds": 67.067,
      "endSeconds": 75.2,
      "narration": "肌肉细胞接到信号，把藏在内部的运糖蛋白送到表面。有了这些入口，葡萄糖才更容易进入肌肉。",
      "group": "muscle-uptake",
      "view": "muscle_cell",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.03e-06,
      "sampleFrames": [
        2055,
        2141,
        2219
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h009",
      "startSeconds": 75.2,
      "endSeconds": 83.667,
      "narration": "长期能量过剩、活动少，再加上遗传等因素，有些人的肌肉和肝脏，对胰岛素的反应会越来越弱。",
      "group": "muscle-uptake",
      "view": "muscle_cell",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.03e-06,
      "sampleFrames": [
        2301,
        2390,
        2471
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h010",
      "startSeconds": 83.667,
      "endSeconds": 92.6,
      "narration": "胰腺一开始会多分泌一些，帮忙补上缺口。等到这份补偿也不够，饭后甚至空腹的血糖，就更容易升高。",
      "group": "muscle-uptake",
      "view": "muscle_cell",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.03e-06,
      "sampleFrames": [
        2558,
        2652,
        2737
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h011",
      "startSeconds": 92.6,
      "endSeconds": 101.533,
      "narration": "肌肉接糖慢，肝脏又可能继续放糖。好比货还没卸完，新货又送来了，这就是胰岛素抵抗带来的麻烦。",
      "group": "muscle-uptake",
      "view": "muscle_cell",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.03e-06,
      "sampleFrames": [
        2826,
        2920,
        3005
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h012",
      "startSeconds": 101.533,
      "endSeconds": 110.567,
      "narration": "所以，第一步可以很具体：甜饮换成水。少添一份容易喝过量的糖，主食照样吃，只把份量和搭配安排好。",
      "group": "muscle-uptake",
      "view": "muscle_cell",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.03e-06,
      "sampleFrames": [
        3094,
        3189,
        3276
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h013",
      "startSeconds": 110.567,
      "endSeconds": 119.733,
      "narration": "吃完饭，坐着刷手机很舒服。也可以先在家里、楼下走一小段，让刚到货的葡萄糖，有地方派上用场。",
      "group": "muscle-uptake",
      "view": "muscle_cell",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.03e-06,
      "sampleFrames": [
        3366,
        3462,
        3550
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h014",
      "startSeconds": 119.733,
      "endSeconds": 128.667,
      "narration": "肌肉收缩时，还能走另一条信号路线，把运糖蛋白送到表面。即使胰岛素反应弱了，这条路也能帮上忙。",
      "group": "muscle-uptake",
      "view": "muscle_cell",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.03e-06,
      "sampleFrames": [
        3640,
        3734,
        3819
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h015",
      "startSeconds": 128.667,
      "endSeconds": 138.233,
      "narration": "当下，肌肉把糖当燃料；经常活动，肌肉处理糖的能力也会适应。散步的价值，不只在体重秤上显出来。",
      "group": "muscle-uptake",
      "view": "muscle_cell",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.03e-06,
      "sampleFrames": [
        3911,
        4012,
        4103
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h016",
      "startSeconds": 138.233,
      "endSeconds": 147.9,
      "narration": "尤其上了年纪，减重时还要留住肌肉。扶着稳固椅子练起坐，或做合适的弹力带练习，和散步各有用处。",
      "group": "preserve-muscle-action",
      "view": "muscle",
      "parent": "personActivity",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 3.2,
      "sampleFrames": [
        4199,
        4300,
        4393
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h017",
      "startSeconds": 147.9,
      "endSeconds": 157.567,
      "narration": "饭桌也得配合：豆腐、鱼、蛋等轮着吃，再加蔬菜和适量主食。只喝稀粥，容易少了蛋白质，也不耐饿。",
      "group": "gut-signals",
      "view": "gut",
      "parent": "small_intestine",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.65,
      "sampleFrames": [
        4489,
        4590,
        4683
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h018",
      "startSeconds": 157.567,
      "endSeconds": 166.333,
      "narration": "可问题来了：少吃一阵子，肚子总惦记着下一顿。吃多少，并不全靠意志，肠道和大脑一直在交换消息。",
      "group": "gut-brain",
      "view": "gut",
      "parent": "small_intestine",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.45,
      "sampleFrames": [
        4774,
        4866,
        4950
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h019",
      "startSeconds": 166.333,
      "endSeconds": 174.933,
      "narration": "研究者做过一个比较：喝糖水，和从静脉把血糖升到相近水平。喝下去时，胰岛素反应常常更强。",
      "group": "gut-signal-experiment",
      "view": "gut",
      "parent": "small_intestine",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.65,
      "sampleFrames": [
        5036,
        5126,
        5209
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h020",
      "startSeconds": 174.933,
      "endSeconds": 188.967,
      "narration": "原来，营养经过肠道时，这里还会发出额外信号。GLP-1就是其中一种，饭后由肠道细胞释放。",
      "group": "gut-signal-experiment",
      "view": "gut",
      "parent": "small_intestine",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.65,
      "sampleFrames": [
        5323,
        5471,
        5605
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h021",
      "startSeconds": 188.967,
      "endSeconds": 197.333,
      "narration": "找到这个信号后，研究者又确认了有活性的片段：它能加强胰岛释放胰岛素，肠道和胰腺就这样连上了。",
      "group": "pancreas-locator",
      "view": "pancreas",
      "parent": "pancreas",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.29,
      "sampleFrames": [
        5714,
        5802,
        5882
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h022",
      "startSeconds": 197.333,
      "endSeconds": 207.533,
      "narration": "GLP-1接上细胞表面的受体，细胞内部的消息便一层层传开。血糖升高时，这会让释放胰岛素的反应更有力。",
      "group": "beta-signals",
      "view": "beta",
      "parent": "pancreas",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 4.3e-05,
      "sampleFrames": [
        5975,
        6082,
        6180
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h023",
      "startSeconds": 207.533,
      "endSeconds": 217.2,
      "narration": "装着胰岛素的小泡来到细胞膜边，释放出里面的胰岛素。信号再随血液送到肝脏和肌肉，接上前面的处理工作。",
      "group": "beta-signals",
      "view": "beta",
      "parent": "pancreas",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 4.3e-05,
      "sampleFrames": [
        6278,
        6379,
        6472
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h024",
      "startSeconds": 217.2,
      "endSeconds": 227.033,
      "narration": "这封消息还有别的去处。GLP-1相关通路参与调节食欲，让吃饭这件事，和大脑感受到的饱足联系起来。",
      "group": "satiety-gastric",
      "view": "stomach",
      "parent": "stomach",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.45,
      "sampleFrames": [
        6569,
        6672,
        6766
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h025",
      "startSeconds": 227.033,
      "endSeconds": 239.367,
      "narration": "它还可以放慢胃把食物送往小肠的速度。于是，食物到达肠道的节奏、饭后的血糖和饱足感，都受到影响。",
      "group": "gastric-emptying",
      "view": "stomach",
      "parent": "stomach",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.62,
      "sampleFrames": [
        6877,
        7007,
        7125
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h026",
      "startSeconds": 239.367,
      "endSeconds": 249.033,
      "narration": "但天然GLP-1在体内很快就会被酶拆解。要把这条发现变成药，研究者先得解决：怎样让信号多留一会儿。",
      "group": "beta-persistence",
      "view": "beta",
      "parent": "pancreas",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 4.3e-05,
      "sampleFrames": [
        7233,
        7334,
        7427
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h027",
      "startSeconds": 249.033,
      "endSeconds": 262.1,
      "narration": "后来，一些药物通过改变分子结构，延长作用时间，同时保留激活受体的能力。司美格鲁肽就是这类药的一种。",
      "group": "beta-persistence",
      "view": "beta",
      "parent": "pancreas",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 4.3e-05,
      "sampleFrames": [
        7541,
        7678,
        7804
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h028",
      "startSeconds": 262.1,
      "endSeconds": 271.033,
      "narration": "这类药参与调节食欲，有些人会更早觉得饱、少惦记食物。原本很难坚持的饭量，才有机会变得容易一些。",
      "group": "gastric-effects",
      "view": "stomach",
      "parent": "stomach",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.62,
      "sampleFrames": [
        7911,
        8005,
        8090
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h029",
      "startSeconds": 271.033,
      "endSeconds": 280.6,
      "narration": "同一套变化，也可能带来恶心、呕吐或便秘。吃到撑、一下吃很多油腻食物，有时会让不舒服更明显。",
      "group": "gastric-effects",
      "view": "stomach",
      "parent": "stomach",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.62,
      "sampleFrames": [
        8182,
        8283,
        8374
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h030",
      "startSeconds": 280.6,
      "endSeconds": 290.267,
      "narration": "出现不适，先把一大餐分小、慢慢吃。持续呕吐、喝不进水，或有持续明显腹痛，都要及时就医评估。",
      "group": "gastric-effects",
      "view": "stomach",
      "parent": "stomach",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.62,
      "sampleFrames": [
        8470,
        8571,
        8664
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h031",
      "startSeconds": 290.267,
      "endSeconds": 299.6,
      "narration": "药物让人吃得少了，蛋白质和其他营养也可能跟着少。力量活动、营养和吃得进去，都关系到肌肉能不能保住。",
      "group": "nutrition-muscle",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "stomach",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.4,
      "sampleFrames": [
        8758,
        8856,
        8946
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h032",
      "startSeconds": 299.6,
      "endSeconds": 309.267,
      "narration": "没用这类药的人，也能调整这一餐：多留一些蔬菜，主食里换进杂豆和全谷物，让饭量有分寸，又能好好吃饭。",
      "group": "gastric-return",
      "view": "stomach",
      "parent": "stomach",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.64,
      "sampleFrames": [
        9040,
        9141,
        9234
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h033",
      "startSeconds": 309.267,
      "endSeconds": 319.0,
      "narration": "糖接走了，食物里的脂肪也在运输。长期吃进来的能量多于用掉的，脂肪会逐渐存起来，有些还会积到肝脏里。",
      "group": "hepatic-export",
      "view": "lipid_liver",
      "parent": "liver",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.53,
      "sampleFrames": [
        9330,
        9432,
        9526
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h034",
      "startSeconds": 319.0,
      "endSeconds": 327.933,
      "narration": "脂肪不容易直接溶在血液里，肝脏就把它装进带外壳的小颗粒。里面有甘油三酯，也有身体需要的胆固醇。",
      "group": "ldl-transport",
      "view": "lipoprotein",
      "parent": "liver",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 4.8e-07,
      "sampleFrames": [
        9618,
        9712,
        9797
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h035",
      "startSeconds": 327.933,
      "endSeconds": 337.6,
      "narration": "有一类颗粒，沿途把甘油三酯交给组织。卸货以后，一部分被肝脏收回，另一部分逐步变成我们常听到的LDL。",
      "group": "ldl-transport",
      "view": "lipoprotein",
      "parent": "liver",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 4.8e-07,
      "sampleFrames": [
        9890,
        9991,
        10084
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h036",
      "startSeconds": 337.6,
      "endSeconds": 347.267,
      "narration": "LDL是一种运输颗粒，胆固醇是它装的货物之一。化验单上的低密度脂蛋白胆固醇，测的是这类颗粒里的胆固醇。",
      "group": "ldl-transport",
      "view": "lipoprotein",
      "parent": "liver",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 4.8e-07,
      "sampleFrames": [
        10180,
        10281,
        10374
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h037",
      "startSeconds": 347.267,
      "endSeconds": 358.2,
      "narration": "送出去以后，还要收回来。肝细胞表面的LDL受体，就像接货的位置，把血里的这些颗粒带进细胞处理。",
      "group": "ldl-transport",
      "view": "lipoprotein",
      "parent": "liver",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 4.8e-07,
      "sampleFrames": [
        10477,
        10591,
        10696
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h038",
      "startSeconds": 358.2,
      "endSeconds": 367.133,
      "narration": "当LDL在血中长期偏多，就更容易进入并滞留在动脉壁里。问题从管壁内部开始，日积月累，才形成斑块。",
      "group": "vessel-plaque",
      "view": "plaque",
      "parent": "aorta",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.033,
      "sampleFrames": [
        10794,
        10888,
        10973
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h039",
      "startSeconds": 367.133,
      "endSeconds": 376.467,
      "narration": "免疫细胞吞下这些脂质，装得越来越多，形成泡沫细胞。局部炎症和组织变化，也让这块斑块慢慢长起来。",
      "group": "foam-cell",
      "view": "plaque",
      "parent": "artery",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 8.5e-05,
      "sampleFrames": [
        11064,
        11162,
        11252
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h040",
      "startSeconds": 376.467,
      "endSeconds": 386.367,
      "narration": "所以还要看吃了什么。肥肉、黄油里的饱和脂肪吃得多，会影响LDL；用适量植物油、鱼和坚果替换更合适。",
      "group": "vessel-plaque-return",
      "view": "plaque",
      "parent": "aorta",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.033,
      "sampleFrames": [
        11347,
        11451,
        11546
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h041",
      "startSeconds": 386.367,
      "endSeconds": 396.033,
      "narration": "有些人调整饮食，LDL还是偏高。常用的他汀，先抑制肝脏制造胆固醇的一个关键步骤，让肝细胞少造一些。",
      "group": "ldl-recovery",
      "view": "lipoprotein",
      "parent": "liver",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 4.8e-07,
      "sampleFrames": [
        11643,
        11744,
        11837
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h042",
      "startSeconds": 396.033,
      "endSeconds": 404.9,
      "narration": "肝细胞里的胆固醇少了，会增加表面的LDL受体。从血液里回收得更多，血中的LDL就能逐渐降下来。",
      "group": "ldl-recovery",
      "view": "lipoprotein",
      "parent": "liver",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 4.8e-07,
      "sampleFrames": [
        11928,
        12021,
        12107
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h043",
      "startSeconds": 404.9,
      "endSeconds": 414.167,
      "narration": "部分人用他汀后会有肌肉酸痛。记下不适出现的时间、活动和新加的药，有助于分清原因、调整治疗。",
      "group": "statin-muscle-context",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.65,
      "sampleFrames": [
        12197,
        12294,
        12383
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h044",
      "startSeconds": 414.167,
      "endSeconds": 423.433,
      "narration": "严重的肌肉损伤很少见。但若明显肌无力，或尿色变深，要尽快就医，排查肌肉、肝脏等问题。",
      "group": "statin-muscle-context",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.65,
      "sampleFrames": [
        12475,
        12572,
        12661
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h045",
      "startSeconds": 423.433,
      "endSeconds": 433.1,
      "narration": "体形瘦的人，也可能因遗传等原因出现高LDL；腰围大的人，则常伴甘油三酯升高。体重和血脂，需要一起看。",
      "group": "lipid-context",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.18,
      "sampleFrames": [
        12755,
        12856,
        12949
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h046",
      "startSeconds": 433.1,
      "endSeconds": 442.433,
      "narration": "无论糖还是脂质，运输都靠心脏推动血液。血液对管壁形成压力，血压计测到的，就是这股压力的变化。",
      "group": "arterial-pulse",
      "view": "pressure",
      "parent": "aorta",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.05,
      "sampleFrames": [
        13043,
        13141,
        13231
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h047",
      "startSeconds": 442.433,
      "endSeconds": 451.7,
      "narration": "心脏收缩，把血推出去，压力升高；心脏舒张时，大动脉的弹性回缩继续推着血走，压力也不会掉到零。",
      "group": "arterial-pulse",
      "view": "pressure",
      "parent": "aorta",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.05,
      "sampleFrames": [
        13323,
        13420,
        13509
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h048",
      "startSeconds": 451.7,
      "endSeconds": 460.467,
      "narration": "血液还要经过许多小动脉。管壁上的肌肉收紧，通道变窄；要维持流动，就得有更大的压力差。",
      "group": "muscle-arteriole",
      "view": "arteriole",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.0032,
      "sampleFrames": [
        13598,
        13690,
        13774
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h049",
      "startSeconds": 460.467,
      "endSeconds": 469.0,
      "narration": "所以，血压高有多种来路：小动脉偏紧、循环里的水钠偏多、大动脉变硬，都可能参与其中。",
      "group": "muscle-arteriole",
      "view": "arteriole",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.0032,
      "sampleFrames": [
        13860,
        13949,
        14031
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h050",
      "startSeconds": 469.0,
      "endSeconds": 477.2,
      "narration": "要找水钠这一头，得顺着血液到肾脏。它把水和小分子滤出来，再把身体要留下的部分收回去。",
      "group": "kidney-locator",
      "view": "kidney",
      "parent": "kidney",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.4,
      "sampleFrames": [
        14114,
        14200,
        14279
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h051",
      "startSeconds": 477.2,
      "endSeconds": 485.333,
      "narration": "肾小管多收回一些钠，水也容易跟着留下。循环里的液体增多，推动血流的负担就可能随之增加。",
      "group": "renal-salt",
      "view": "nephron",
      "parent": "kidney",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.0078,
      "sampleFrames": [
        14359,
        14445,
        14523
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h052",
      "startSeconds": 485.333,
      "endSeconds": 494.9,
      "narration": "饭桌上的盐，不只在盐罐里。汤、酱油、腌菜和加工肉，也能积出不少；先少喝咸汤，是很具体的一步。",
      "group": "renal-salt",
      "view": "nephron",
      "parent": "kidney",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.0078,
      "sampleFrames": [
        14611,
        14712,
        14803
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h053",
      "startSeconds": 494.9,
      "endSeconds": 503.833,
      "narration": "肾脏还有一套保住血压的办法。感到灌注不足时，它能释放肾素，接力生成一种让血管收紧的信号。",
      "group": "renal-control",
      "view": "autonomic",
      "parent": "kidney",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.86,
      "sampleFrames": [
        14895,
        14989,
        15074
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h054",
      "startSeconds": 503.833,
      "endSeconds": 513.5,
      "narration": "这种信号叫血管紧张素二。它让小动脉收紧，还能促使肾上腺释放醛固酮，通知肾脏多留一点钠。",
      "group": "renal-control",
      "view": "autonomic",
      "parent": "kidney",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.86,
      "sampleFrames": [
        15167,
        15268,
        15361
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h055",
      "startSeconds": 513.5,
      "endSeconds": 522.833,
      "narration": "失血、缺水时，这套办法有用；可它长期偏活跃，血管一直收紧、水钠留得多，血压就更难降下来。",
      "group": "renal-control",
      "view": "autonomic",
      "parent": "kidney",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.86,
      "sampleFrames": [
        15455,
        15553,
        15643
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h056",
      "startSeconds": 522.833,
      "endSeconds": 532.5,
      "narration": "内脏和肾脏周围的脂肪增多，会通过多种方式干扰这套调节。交感神经、激素和肾脏留钠，都可能参与。",
      "group": "renal-control",
      "view": "autonomic",
      "parent": "kidney",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.86,
      "sampleFrames": [
        15737,
        15838,
        15931
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h057",
      "startSeconds": 532.5,
      "endSeconds": 541.767,
      "narration": "交感神经一兴奋，心脏会加把劲，一些血管也会收紧。长期睡不好、反复缺氧等问题，也会增加调节负担。",
      "group": "renal-control",
      "view": "autonomic",
      "parent": "kidney",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.86,
      "sampleFrames": [
        16025,
        16122,
        16211
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h058",
      "startSeconds": 541.767,
      "endSeconds": 550.867,
      "narration": "如果睡觉打鼾，还反复憋醒、白天犯困，要想到睡眠呼吸暂停。它和肥胖常常相伴，也会牵动血压。",
      "group": "airway",
      "view": "brainheart",
      "parent": "brainstem",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.21,
      "sampleFrames": [
        16302,
        16397,
        16485
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h059",
      "startSeconds": 550.867,
      "endSeconds": 560.033,
      "narration": "确诊阻塞性睡眠呼吸暂停后，有人需要正压通气，用气压撑住上气道，减少反复缺氧；减重也能帮忙。",
      "group": "airway",
      "view": "brainheart",
      "parent": "brainstem",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.21,
      "sampleFrames": [
        16575,
        16671,
        16759
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h060",
      "startSeconds": 560.033,
      "endSeconds": 568.967,
      "narration": "当生活调整还不够，降压药会从不同环节帮忙。像氨氯地平，会减少钙进入管壁肌肉细胞，让小动脉放松。",
      "group": "arteriole-treatment",
      "view": "arteriole",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.0026,
      "sampleFrames": [
        16849,
        16943,
        17028
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h061",
      "startSeconds": 568.967,
      "endSeconds": 578.467,
      "narration": "小动脉松开，外周阻力就会下降。部分人会出现脚踝肿、脸热或头晕，这些反应也要和血压一起观察。",
      "group": "arteriole-treatment",
      "view": "arteriole",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.0026,
      "sampleFrames": [
        17120,
        17220,
        17311
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h062",
      "startSeconds": 578.467,
      "endSeconds": 588.133,
      "narration": "另一类常见的沙坦类药物，会挡住血管紧张素二的接收位置。血管少收紧一些，醛固酮相关的留钠信号也减弱。",
      "group": "arteriole-treatment",
      "view": "arteriole",
      "parent": "muscle",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.0026,
      "sampleFrames": [
        17406,
        17507,
        17600
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h063",
      "startSeconds": 588.133,
      "endSeconds": 597.8,
      "narration": "这类药可能让血钾升高，肾功能也需要监测。正在用药时，别因为听说低钠盐好，就自行大量加含钾的盐。",
      "group": "renal-treatment",
      "view": "nephron",
      "parent": "kidney",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.0072,
      "sampleFrames": [
        17696,
        17797,
        17890
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h064",
      "startSeconds": 597.8,
      "endSeconds": 606.667,
      "narration": "还有常用的噻嗪或噻嗪样利尿剂，减少肾小管回收钠，让多余的钠和水排出去，帮助控制血压。",
      "group": "renal-treatment",
      "view": "nephron",
      "parent": "kidney",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.0072,
      "sampleFrames": [
        17981,
        18074,
        18160
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h065",
      "startSeconds": 606.667,
      "endSeconds": 616.233,
      "narration": "但排水排盐也可能带走过多钾，出现乏力、抽筋或头晕。身体脱水时更要留意，复查电解质有实际用处。",
      "group": "renal-treatment",
      "view": "nephron",
      "parent": "kidney",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.0072,
      "sampleFrames": [
        18251,
        18352,
        18443
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h066",
      "startSeconds": 616.233,
      "endSeconds": 625.9,
      "narration": "用药以后，要看一段时间的记录。今天偏低、明天偏高，可能和测量条件、睡眠或活动有关，别只盯一个数。",
      "group": "measurement",
      "view": "homecheck",
      "parent": "measurement",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 2.85,
      "sampleFrames": [
        18539,
        18640,
        18733
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h067",
      "startSeconds": 625.9,
      "endSeconds": 636.033,
      "narration": "测量前安静坐至少五分钟，背靠稳、双脚落地。把手臂托好，让上臂袖带的中部接近心脏高度，再记录读数。",
      "group": "measurement",
      "view": "homecheck",
      "parent": "measurement",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 2.85,
      "sampleFrames": [
        18831,
        18938,
        19035
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h068",
      "startSeconds": 636.033,
      "endSeconds": 645.6,
      "narration": "血压控制，是为了减轻血管和器官持续承受的负担。高血压和高血糖，也会让本来就有斑块的血管更容易出问题。",
      "group": "vessel-clot",
      "view": "thrombus",
      "parent": "aorta",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.042,
      "sampleFrames": [
        19132,
        19233,
        19324
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h069",
      "startSeconds": 645.6,
      "endSeconds": 655.267,
      "narration": "斑块在管壁里慢慢长；血栓，则是血液在不该凝固的地方结成一团。有时，危险就发生在两者接上的那一刻。",
      "group": "vessel-clot",
      "view": "thrombus",
      "parent": "aorta",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.042,
      "sampleFrames": [
        19420,
        19521,
        19614
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h070",
      "startSeconds": 655.267,
      "endSeconds": 663.567,
      "narration": "斑块表面一旦破裂，血液接触到里面的成分，血小板会黏过来、聚成团，凝血反应也被启动。",
      "group": "vessel-clot",
      "view": "thrombus",
      "parent": "aorta",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.042,
      "sampleFrames": [
        19702,
        19789,
        19869
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h071",
      "startSeconds": 663.567,
      "endSeconds": 672.433,
      "narration": "同时，纤维蛋白像细丝一样织成网，把血细胞和血小板固定住。血块越长越大，就可能突然堵住血流。",
      "group": "vessel-clot",
      "view": "thrombus",
      "parent": "aorta",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.042,
      "sampleFrames": [
        19954,
        20047,
        20133
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h072",
      "startSeconds": 672.433,
      "endSeconds": 682.1,
      "narration": "阿司匹林这一类抗血小板药，重点是减少血小板聚集。在某些已经发生心梗、缺血性卒中等情况下，会用到它。",
      "group": "vessel-clot",
      "view": "thrombus",
      "parent": "aorta",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.042,
      "sampleFrames": [
        20225,
        20326,
        20419
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h073",
      "startSeconds": 682.1,
      "endSeconds": 691.767,
      "narration": "还有一种情况是房颤：心房收缩乱了，局部血流容易淤滞，可能在心脏里形成血栓，再顺着血流跑到脑部。",
      "group": "atrial-clot",
      "view": "brainheart",
      "parent": "heart",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.105,
      "sampleFrames": [
        20515,
        20616,
        20709
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h074",
      "startSeconds": 691.767,
      "endSeconds": 702.067,
      "narration": "这时需要考虑的抗凝药，作用在凝血过程中的不同环节，减少血栓形成或继续长大的机会，和抗血小板药用途有区别。",
      "group": "atrial-clot",
      "view": "brainheart",
      "parent": "heart",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 0.105,
      "sampleFrames": [
        20808,
        20916,
        21015
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h075",
      "startSeconds": 702.067,
      "endSeconds": 711.233,
      "narration": "抗凝药不能拿来降血压。降压管压力，降脂减少有害脂质负担，抗血小板和抗凝处理特定的血栓风险。",
      "group": "clinical-summary",
      "view": "brainheart",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.18,
      "sampleFrames": [
        21111,
        21207,
        21295
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h076",
      "startSeconds": 711.233,
      "endSeconds": 720.267,
      "narration": "抗栓治疗的另一面，是更容易出血。仅仅有三高，就自己加上阿司匹林或抗凝药，可能添出新的麻烦。",
      "group": "clinical-summary",
      "view": "brainheart",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.18,
      "sampleFrames": [
        21385,
        21480,
        21567
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h077",
      "startSeconds": 720.267,
      "endSeconds": 729.833,
      "narration": "如果突然嘴歪、说不清话、一侧胳膊没力，要立即拨打一二零。急症来时，不能等吃点药、睡一觉再看看。",
      "group": "clinical-summary",
      "view": "brainheart",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.18,
      "sampleFrames": [
        21659,
        21760,
        21851
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h078",
      "startSeconds": 729.833,
      "endSeconds": 739.567,
      "narration": "再看这顿饭：甜饮换水，咸汤少喝；主食配好份量，蔬菜和蛋白质留下。每个改动，都对应刚才的一段过程。",
      "group": "closing-meal",
      "view": "meal",
      "parent": "mealPerson",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 3.2,
      "sampleFrames": [
        21947,
        22049,
        22143
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h079",
      "startSeconds": 739.567,
      "endSeconds": 749.233,
      "narration": "活动也能拆开做：饭后走一段，久坐时起身动动，再留些时间练力量。强度从自己能完成的程度慢慢加。",
      "group": "daily-activity",
      "view": "muscle",
      "parent": "personActivity",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 3.25,
      "sampleFrames": [
        22239,
        22340,
        22433
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h080",
      "startSeconds": 749.233,
      "endSeconds": 758.9,
      "narration": "如果每晚饿得睡不着，第二天又吃到撑，这种办法就很难维持。把每餐安排得有饱足感，比天天硬忍更实际。",
      "group": "daily-feedback",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.9,
      "sampleFrames": [
        22529,
        22630,
        22723
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h081",
      "startSeconds": 758.9,
      "endSeconds": 766.233,
      "narration": "睡眠也在这张网里。经常睡不够，会影响食欲调节，让人更想吃，也更难察觉已经吃饱。",
      "group": "daily-feedback",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.9,
      "sampleFrames": [
        22806,
        22883,
        22954
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h082",
      "startSeconds": 766.233,
      "endSeconds": 775.1,
      "narration": "当多余脂肪逐渐减少，肌肉和肝脏对胰岛素的反应可能改善；肾脏留钠、神经升压的负担，也可能减轻。",
      "group": "daily-feedback",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.9,
      "sampleFrames": [
        23034,
        23127,
        23213
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h083",
      "startSeconds": 775.1,
      "endSeconds": 784.767,
      "narration": "体重负担轻一些，活动可能更容易；肌肉练得更有力，又更有条件保持活动。这些变化，可以互相帮一把。",
      "group": "daily-feedback",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.9,
      "sampleFrames": [
        23305,
        23406,
        23499
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h084",
      "startSeconds": 784.767,
      "endSeconds": 794.033,
      "narration": "但体重回落时，身体也可能增加饥饿感、减少能量消耗，把人往原来的体重拉。遇到平台期，并不稀奇。",
      "group": "daily-feedback",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.9,
      "sampleFrames": [
        23593,
        23690,
        23779
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h085",
      "startSeconds": 794.033,
      "endSeconds": 803.2,
      "narration": "这时更需要能重复的饭菜、活动和睡眠安排；需要药物帮助的人，也要把营养和生活习惯一起接上。",
      "group": "daily-feedback",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.9,
      "sampleFrames": [
        23870,
        23966,
        24054
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h086",
      "startSeconds": 803.2,
      "endSeconds": 813.733,
      "narration": "接下来，除了体重，还看腰围、血压、血糖和血脂的趋势。能不能走得稳、吃得下、有力气，同样值得记录。",
      "group": "review-measurement",
      "view": "homecheck",
      "parent": "measurement",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 2.8,
      "sampleFrames": [
        24152,
        24263,
        24364
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h087",
      "startSeconds": 813.733,
      "endSeconds": 822.667,
      "narration": "如果瘦了以后经常头晕，或原来的药让血糖偏低，就带着记录，和治疗团队调整既有用药；别自行停药。",
      "group": "review-measurement",
      "view": "homecheck",
      "parent": "measurement",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 2.8,
      "sampleFrames": [
        24460,
        24554,
        24639
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h088",
      "startSeconds": 822.667,
      "endSeconds": 832.867,
      "narration": "三高管理，靠的是几个环节一起慢慢调顺：吃进去的、身体用掉的、血管承受的，再加上需要时有针对性的药。",
      "group": "closing-body",
      "view": "torso",
      "parent": "torso",
      "cameraDistanceMetres": 1.45,
      "sampleFrames": [
        24735,
        24842,
        24940
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "h089",
      "startSeconds": 832.867,
      "endSeconds": 842.033,
      "narration": "下一顿饭，不妨先换掉那杯甜饮，吃完陪家人走一小段。看懂身体怎么工作，改变就有了具体的落脚处。",
      "group": "closing-life",
